      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already checked the amount and currency, they are definitely integers in the right format. i've even tried different test cards from the stripe docs and it's still happening. it almost feels like something is intentionally sabotaging the request right at the moment it sends. could it be a weird edge case with the way the payload is being constructed or something in the headers? it's super frustrating, it's like the error just pops up out of nowhere for no reason.",
