      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If standard payload checks are passing, the issue might reside in authorization or headers, even with test data. Carefully review your `Authorization` header to ensure the API secret key is correctly formatted as `Bearer sk_test_...`. Additionally, check the `Content-Type` header, which must be set to `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` or `application/json` depending on your endpoint. Seeing the exact error response body, beyond just the 402 code, is crucial for pinpointing the hidden cause.",
